  "bodyHash": "6df63b6585fea4af",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">輕鬆潛影盒</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓您可以直接在物品欄中與潛影盒進行完整互動。插入物品、移除物品、瀏覽內容並管理儲存空間，無需將盒子放置在地上。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">受《我的世界》現代束口袋機制的啟發，此模組讓便攜式儲存變得更自然直覺。滾動瀏覽儲存內容🖱️、精確選擇想要的物品🎯、透過簡單點擊移動物品進出、使用滑鼠拖曳跨槽位轉移物品，或啟用單件模式以進行精細的物品欄管理。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了原版潛影盒之外，此模組也支援終界箱，並可透過資料包擴展以兼容其他模組的儲存物品。🔗</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">與單純的工具提示模組不同，這並非僅限客戶端的模組。它添加了真正的物品欄互動功能，必須同時安裝在客戶端與伺服器上。如果您只想在工具提示中預覽潛影盒內容，請查看客戶端替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shulkerboxtooltip\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shulker Box Tooltip</span></a>由 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/misterpemodder\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MisterPeModder</span></a> 開發。💡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">也有在使用束口袋？不妨試試 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bundle-upgrade\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Bundle Upgrade</span></a>，它為《我的世界》的束口袋帶來了相同的生活品質改善！🎒</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">基於物品欄的儲存存取：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無需將它們放置在世界中，即可直接從支援的儲存物品插入和提取物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔍 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細內容預覽：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">直接在物品工具提示中檢視儲存內容，讓您一眼就能清楚每個儲存物品裡裝了什麼。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選擇任意已儲存的物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵，精確選擇您想互動的已儲存物品，不再受限於最後插入的那一個。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">已選物品詳細資訊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">瀏覽儲存內容時，即時查看目前所選物品的額外詳細資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品轉移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">將物品點擊至儲存物品上，或將儲存物品點擊至物品欄槽位，即可快速將內容移入或移出。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨多個槽位拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在物品欄槽位上點擊並拖曳，即可大量插入或提取物品，大幅提升物品欄管理效率。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">按住 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Control</span></code> 鍵（Mac 為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code>）可改為移動單個物品而非整組，並精確控制轉移數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">儲存容量指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選地在支援的儲存物品上直接顯示束口袋風格的容量條，讓您一眼掌握剩餘容量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智慧相容性指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">視覺提示會顯示手中物品是否可以插入，以及內部是否已有相符物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可客製化：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自訂互動方式、控制設定、工具提示行為與視覺功能，以符合您的遊玩習慣。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔗 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資料包驅動相容性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可透過資料包新增對其他儲存物品的支援，實現與多種模組背包及儲存方案的整合。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">必須安裝於客戶端與伺服器</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC & NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組提供設定選項，可直接使用模組選單在遊戲內進行設定（Fabric 版需安裝由 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a> 開發的 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a>）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code> 目錄下，檔名依設定類型分別為 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code>、<code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code> 或 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code>。並非所有模組都會包含全部類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kir_antipov\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Kir_Antipov</span></a> 啟發了終界箱功能，該靈感來自其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packed-inventory\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Packed Inventory</span></a> 模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrniddala\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MrNiddala</span></a>，其啟發了透過拖曳物品至不同物品欄槽位來向容器物品插入或提取物品的功能。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bloomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bloomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/climate-rivers\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/climaterivers/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/shroomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/shroomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
